    "voice": "produce_events/102200404/1022004040250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004040260,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "お母さんが大変そうで、だから……\r\n笑ってもらいたいだけだったんです、多分",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200404/1022004040260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022004040270,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……お手伝いをしたら笑ってくれるかなとか\r\nお勉強ができたら、喜んでくれるんじゃないかって思って",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200404/1022004040270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、小糸の真面目な性格は\r\n家族想いなところから来てるんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
